<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Moneycaps — Email confirmed</title>
<style>
  :root { --bg:#f4f0e1; --card:#ffffff; --ink:#1f2a24; --muted:#5d6a62; --line:#e2dcc8; --accent:#3f6b4f; --bad:#b3402f; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg:#14191a; --card:#1d2425; --ink:#eef1ee; --muted:#9aa8a0; --line:#2b3536; --accent:#8fc4a1; --bad:#f0907e; }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin:0; min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif; }
  main { width:100%; max-width:440px; padding:24px 16px; }
  .card { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px; padding:32px 24px; text-align:center; }
  .icon { width:64px; height:64px; border-radius:50%; margin:0 auto 16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:32px; color:#fff; background:var(--accent); }
  .icon.bad { background:var(--bad); }
  h1 { font-size:22px; margin:0 0 8px; }
  p { margin:8px 0 0; color:var(--muted); }
  .steps { text-align:left; margin:20px 0 0; padding:14px 16px 14px 34px; background:var(--bg); border-radius:12px; color:var(--ink); }
  .steps li { margin:4px 0; }
  a { color:var(--accent); }
  .small { font-size:13px; margin-top:20px; }
  [hidden] { display:none !important; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <div class="card" id="ok">
    <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
    <h1>Email confirmed</h1>
    <p>Your Moneycaps account is ready.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Close this page.</li>
      <li>Open the <strong>Moneycaps</strong> app.</li>
      <li>Log in with your email and password.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="small">Emel anda telah disahkan. Tutup halaman ini, buka app Moneycaps dan log masuk.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="bad" hidden>
    <div class="icon bad" aria-hidden="true">!</div>
    <h1>This link has expired</h1>
    <p>The confirmation link is invalid or was already used. If you already confirmed, just open Moneycaps and log in. Otherwise, try signing up or logging in again in the app to get a new email.</p>
    <p class="small">Pautan ini tidak sah atau telah tamat tempoh. Cuba daftar atau log masuk semula dalam app untuk dapatkan emel baharu.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="small" style="text-align:center"><a href="../">Privacy Policy</a></p>
</main>
<script>
  // Supabase appends the result of the confirmation to the URL (#error=… on
  // failure). Read it, then strip it so nothing sensitive stays in history.
  (function () {
    var hash = window.location.hash || '';
    if (/(^|[#&])error(_code|_description)?=/.test(hash)) {
      document.getElementById('ok').hidden = true;
      document.getElementById('bad').hidden = false;
    }
    if (hash || window.location.search) {
      history.replaceState(null, '', window.location.pathname);
    }
  })();
</script>
</body>
</html>
